        "headline": "Advertising mail received per household: published values for FY2023 and how they moved.",
        "statements": [
          {
            "text": "In FY2023, Advertising mail received per household was 436.8 (pieces per household per year). That fell by 62.4 (12.5%) from the previous year, FY2022. That fell by 156.0 (26.3%) from five years earlier, FY2018.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2023,
              2022,
              2018
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "By income in FY2023, Advertising mail received per household (pieces per household per year) was highest for Over $100K at 551.2 and lowest for Under $35K at 254.8.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "By age in FY2023, Advertising mail received per household (pieces per household per year) was highest for Over 55 at 577.2 and lowest for Under 35 at 202.8.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2023
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "By education in FY2023, Advertising mail received per household (pieces per household per year) was highest for College graduate at 483.6 and lowest for Less than high school at 301.6.",
            "metric": "advertising-mail-received-per-household",
            "years": [
              2023
            ]
          }
        ],
        "caveats": [
